<#ff8c1e>RYUJI (ASSIST)</>
Ryuji		^X
  Calls Ryuji when his gauge (the bar with his portrait at
  the bottom of the screen) is full. Cancels from normals on contact.
  He runs in and attacks. He counters projectiles fired at
  him. The gauge refills in about 6 seconds.

<#ff8c1e>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Guard Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		^A_+^B
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B

<#ff8c1e>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chains: Light into Medium into Heavy, standing into
  crouching.
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff8c1e>SPECIALS</>
  C is the strongest version.
  One launcher per combo: 2C, Demon Thrust, Tiger Upper, Sled
  Ram and their EX versions, once one of them has hit.
Demon Thrust		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Hold _F or _B to steer it.
Tiger Upper		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Sled Ram (ground/air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff8c1e>EX (1 bar)</>
  Any two of A / B / C.
Demonic Chaos		_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Tiger Raid		_F_D_DF^A_+^B
Sled Crasher (ground/air)		_D_DB_B^A_+^B

<#ff8c1e>SUPERS</>
Curbstomp (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Lunge into a rush and a launcher.
T&D Connection (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C. Command grab with Ryuji.
Curbstomp Symphony (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Cinematic grab.
